  "description": "Welcome to Frost Vale, a frozen Nordic valley buried in snow, ice, and ancient mystery.\n\nExplore a vast, icy landscape inspired by Nordic wilderness — towering mountains, frozen forests, and silent ruins hidden beneath the frost. Wander through the valley as you search for hidden locations.\n\nThere are no rushing timers — only the cold wind, the echo of your footsteps, and the thrill of discovery. \n\n Features:\n\n>Beautiful frozen Nordic valley environment\n\n>Calm exploration-based gameplay\n\n>Search for hidden secrets\n\n>Atmospheric snow, ice, and winter scenery\n\n>Immersive and relaxing experience",
